---Create repository
---
---**Accepted credentials:** User token, Plugin installation token.
---
---An account needs create permission on the project. A plugin installation's access token needs repositories:create. The repository goes in the installation's project and joins its coverage. A successful create does not guarantee token readiness. A failed grant reconciliation leaves the repository created and can delay token minting. An installation token cannot set clusterHost or mirrorClusterSlugs. An installation creates at most its plugin's daily limit of repositories in a rolling 24 hours (100 by default). Exceeding this limit returns 429 with Retry-After.
---
---`POST /api/v1/repos`
---Errors: RepoNameInUse, RepoNameInvalid.
---@param input entire.repos.CreateRepoRequest
---@return entire.repos.CreatedRepo? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
